config DF_PROTO
	tristate "DialectForge protocol family (AF_DIALECTFORGE)"
	depends on DIALECTFORGE && NET
	default y
	help
	  Register AF_DIALECTFORGE as a native protocol family.
	  Processes can create DF sockets directly:
	    socket(AF_DIALECTFORGE, SOCK_STREAM, 0)
	  All communication is automatically dialect-encrypted.

